// The small-integer fast paths of include/sea/Expr/SmallArith.hh (SeaM
// offset arithmetic, the bit-vector normal form) give the value of their GMP
// definitions at the 64-bit boundaries (INT64_MIN / MAX, mixed signs, values
// beyond 64 bits, widths up to 128). unittests/SmallArith.
RUN: sea-small-arith-test | FileCheck %s
CHECK: test: mod-pow2 ok
CHECK: test: add-sub ok
CHECK: test: circular ok
CHECK: failures: 0

